{
  "key": 51558,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00000",
      "en_US": "Anthony"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "By the way, I’m a Hiker, so I often go\n",
        "to mountains and caves.\r",
        "I don’t usually go to the town.\r",
        "I bet you go to all kinds of towns on\n",
        "your journey, don’t you?\r",
        "You know, if we were to trade phone\n",
        "numbers, then we could exchange\f",
        "all kinds of information, yes? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll give you a call when I think of a\n",
        "good, heart-warming story, OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s so sad. I might just end up\n",
        "secluding myself in the mountain..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "What do you say?\n",
        "Would you like to exchange numbers\f",
        "with another adventurer? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re nearby, and yet you’re going to\n",
        "call me on the phone?\r",
        "Am I that “dazzling” that you need to\n",
        "keep your distance?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "The other day, I was watching my\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} eat some Berries.\f",
        "It looked like it was enjoying its meal,\f",
        "so I decided to try some.\r",
        "I’m not sure if people should eat that\n",
        "stuff, but it was delicious!\r",
        "All right then!\n",
        "Be good!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Lately, I’ve been running across wild\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} quite often.\f",
        "They’re easily taken care of.\r",
        "All right then!\n",
        "Be good!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh yeah, I was battling this\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} the other day...\f",
        "It took off when I got distracted by a\f",
        "passing Beauty.\r",
        "Learn from my mistake--always stay\n",
        "focused on the job at hand!\r",
        "All right then!\n",
        "Be good!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Come on--let’s battle right now!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} is where I am.\n",
        "Come on over if you feel up to it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello! You haven’t forgotten about our\n",
        "battle, have you?\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}! I’m waiting!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0711_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "I wonder why I like mountains so much...\r",
        "It wouldn’t be wrong to say I also like\n",
        "the Pokémon that dwell on mountains.\r",
        "But I bet that the number one reason is\n",
        "that I just like mountains.\r",
        "I have no idea what a Swimmer♂’s\n",
        "thinking..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
